  "notes": "{抜|ぬ}ける is an intransitive ichidan verb with multiple meanings: to come out, be missing, or pass through.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧: {抜|ぬ}ける (to come out/fall out)\n- ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧: ⟦{抜|ぬ}く→抜く：02384_nuku⟧ (to pull out)\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- ⟦{気|き}→気：02199_ki⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{抜|ぬ}ける: to feel deflated/let down\n- ⟦{腰|こし}→腰：02210_koshi⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{抜|ぬ}ける: legs give way (from shock)\n- ⟦{魂|たましい}→魂：14639_tamashii⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{抜|ぬ}ける: to be dazed\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{髪|かみ}→髪：02196_kami⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{毛|け}→毛：01392_ke⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{抜|ぬ}ける: hair falls out\n- ⟦トンネル→トンネル：03865_tonneru⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{抜|ぬ}ける: to pass through a tunnel\n- ⟦{名前|なまえ}→名前：02234_namae⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{抜|ぬ}け→抜く：02384_nuku⟧て⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧: a name is missing",
